{"version":1,"key":"card:338","content":{"id":338,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在执行多个 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Promise","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 时，我们一般是使用 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Promise.all","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 来同时并发执行多个 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Promise","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，但是在资源有限的情况下，我们需要控制同时执行的 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Promise","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的数量，可以通过 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"p-limit","code":true},{"text":" 这个库来做到这一点。","type":"formatted"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"安装："}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"npm install p-limit --save","language":"shell","uuid":"f469887f-2a00-4a6b-8eed-6bd15390f318","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"使用："}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"import pLimit from 'p-limit';\n\n// 最多同时执行 5 个 Promise\nconst generator = pLimit(5);","language":"js","uuid":"d6874fe6-b18f-473b-9725-d2968700e2f4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"将需要执行的任务和所需的参数传递给 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"generator","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，该 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"generator","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 返回一个 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Promise","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，当任务被调度执行完成时，这个 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Promise","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的状态将会变成 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"resolved","code":true}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"import delay from 'delay';\n\nconst tasks = Array.from({ length: 100 }, () => generator(() => delay(100)));\nawait Promise.all(tasks);","language":"js","uuid":"99bee674-d9fc-4f8d-85a8-a687e654153f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"下面分别设置不同的 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"limit","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 来运行 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"100","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 个任务，每个任务运行 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"100ms","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，观察总体的运行时间"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"import pLimit from 'p-limit';\nimport delay from 'delay';\n\nconst runTask = async (limit) => {\n  const generator = pLimit(limit);\n  const start = Date.now();\n  const tasks = Array.from({ length: 100 }, () => generator(() => delay(100)));\n  await Promise.all(tasks);\n  const end = Date.now();\n  return end - start;\n}\n\nconst limits = [5, 10, 20, 50, 100];\nconst results = await Promise.all(limits.map(limit => runTask(limit)));\nconst times = limits.map((limit, index) => ({ limit, time: results[index] }));\n\nconsole.table(times);","language":"js","uuid":"968eb6e7-9d71-45fc-a287-2014f4b1d86c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"┌─────────┬───────┬──────┐\n│ (index) │ limit │ time │\n├─────────┼───────┼──────┤\n│    0    │   5   │ 2017 │\n│    1    │  10   │ 1012 │\n│    2    │  20   │ 509  │\n│    3    │  50   │ 205  │\n│    4    │  100  │ 105  │\n└─────────┴───────┴──────┘","language":"console","uuid":"0906b977-0591-4195-a8f6-f9ebff8532c8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"因为每个任务基本不占用 CPU 的时间，所需时间基本符合"}]},{"type":"block-math","tex":"\\text{total time} = \\frac{\\text{number of tasks}}{\\text{limit}} \\times \\text{signle task time}","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}],"tags":["JavaScript/三方库/p-limit"],"createTime":1696754108417,"updateTime":1743303640425,"linkedCards":[{"id":285,"target":{"key":"card:285","type":"card","id":285},"summary":"JavaScript 是单线程的，为了不阻塞线程，很多方法都是异步的，通过回调函数的形式来处理函数结果，这就会带来一个问题，当回调特别多时，代码的可读性急剧下降 getUser(function(user) { getOrders(user...","tags":["JavaScript/Promise"]},{"id":296,"target":{"key":"card:296","type":"card","id":296},"summary":"Promise.all 接收一个 Promise 对象组成的数组，返回一个 Promise ，只有当数组中的所有 Promise 都 resolved 后，返回的 Promise 才会变为 resolved 状态，并且将所有 Promise...","tags":["JavaScript/Promise"]}]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1743303640425}}